Title: The Open 2025: Huge crowds descend on Royal Portrush for Rory McIlroy's practice round
Date: 2025-07-14
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [], 'Description': [{'Description': "Golf fans descended in great numbers on Monday morning to catch Rory McIlroy's first practice round at Royal Portrush ahead of this week's Open.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 111}}, {'Description': 'The world number two - who won his Open title at Hoylake in 2014 - delighted the sizeable galleries on Monday morning, holing a birdie putt on the 18th green before signing autographs for 15 minutes.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 4, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 184}}, {'Description': 'McIlroy is due to speak to the media at 14:00 BST on Monday, followed by 2019 champion Shane Lowry at 15:00 BST.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 5, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 109}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'Rory Mcilroy signs autographs for fans'}]}
